    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even \"getting through the next hour\" feels like a joke. what for? just to sit in this house and wait for more things to disappear? it feels like the world is just a sequence of losing things you love until there's nothing left. it's so exhausting just trying to pretend there's a reason to keep going when everything feels so empty and pointless.",
